 "nct_id": "NCT00261352",
 "brief_title": "GALLANT 14 Tesaglitazar vs. Metformin and Fenofibrate",
 "official_title": "A 24-Week Randomised, Double-Blind, Parallel-Group, Multi-Centre, Active-Controlled (Metformin or Metformin Combined With Fenofibrate) Study to Evaluate the Lipid Metabolic Effects, Safety and Tolerability of Tesaglitazar Therapy in Patients With Type 2 Diabetes and Low HDL-Cholesterol on a Fixed Background Therapy With a Statin",
